OL,1,Vk4                               G4/9
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGOFFICER HELD HOSTAGE AT
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGDURHAM PRISON
OL,4,D
OL,5, A prison officer who was taken hostage
OL,6, at knifepoint in Durham prison by two
OL,7, inmates has been released.
OL,8,F
OL,9,FThe officer was seized yesterday as he
OL,10,Funlocked a cell. He was later exchanged
OL,11,Ffor another officer and one inmate gave
OL,12,Fhimself up during the swap.
OL,14,FThe Home Office requested a news
OL,15,Fblackout for fear that media coverage
OL,16,Fmight endanger the officer's life. One
OL,17,Fprisoner had been jailed for murder.
OL,19,FIt was lifted at about 0830 after the
OL,20,Fsecond man was overpowered. Two prison
OL,21,Fofficers were slightly hurt.
OL,23,D]FFromG05-04-90F/ teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
FL,182,190,120,250,0,100
