OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGIRISHMAN IN DUTCH COURT
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGON ARMS CHARGES
OL,4,D
OL,5, Irishman Anthony Kerr has been given a
OL,6, six-month jail sentence on arms charges
OL,7, by a Dutch court.
OL,9,FMr Kerr, thought to be a member of the
OL,10,FIrish People's Liberation Organisation,
OL,11,Fwas arrested in Amsterdam last December
OL,12,Fin connection with the shooting of a
OL,13,FBelgian policeman.
OL,14,F
OL,15,FA machine gun and six pistols were
OL,16,Ffound in his possession.
OL,17,F
OL,18,FAfter serving his sentence, he will be
OL,19,Fextradited to Belgium where he will
OL,20,Fface attempted manslaughter charges.
OL,21,F
OL,23,D]FFromG05-04-90F/ teletextarchive.com
