OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGSTEVENS REPORT WITH
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGRUC CHIEF CONSTABLE
OL,4,D
OL,5, RUC chief constable Hugh Annesley has
OL,6, received the report of the Stevens
OL,7, investigation into leaks of security
OL,8, force material to Loyalist terrorists.
OL,9,F
OL,10,FJohn Stevens, the deputy chief
OL,11,Fconstable of Cambridgeshire, and a team
OL,12,Fof detectives have been investigating
OL,13,Fin Northern Ireland since September.
OL,15,FThe investigation was called after the
OL,16,FUlster Freedom Fighters claimed they
OL,17,Fused security force material to target
OL,18,FCatholic Loughlin McGinn.
OL,20,FMr Annesley and Mr Stevens are to make
OL,21,Fstatements later.
OL,23,D]FFromG05-04-90F/ teletextarchive.com
